BURDEN GHOST — ONE-PAGE OFFICIAL PRESS KIT

ABOUT THE ARTIST
BURDEN GHOST is the artistic project of Jonathan Perez, a Salvadoran artist born October 3, 1993, in Nueva Guadalupe, El Salvador. The project blends dark, emotionally driven alternative rap and metal influences, exploring isolation, struggle, transformation and the parts of ourselves usually kept hidden.

